  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit and Financial Services: Project to Revitalize Crop and Livestock Production in the Savannah</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of PREPAS is to contribute to the reduction of poverty and the improvement of food and nutritional security in a sustainable manner in the sub-prefectures of Bouar, Baoro, Bossempt&#xE9;l&#xE9; and Yalok&#xE9;. The development objective is to strengthen the socio-economic development framework and revive plant and animal production through climate change-adapted approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
